('A bleeding trauma patient without head injury awaits surgery. Systolic pressure to aim for?',
 '80 to 90 mmHg', ['50 to 60 mmHg', '120 to 130 mmHg', 'Above 140 mmHg'],
 'European guidance on major bleeding advises permissive hypotension, a systolic pressure of 80 to 90 mmHg, until bleeding is controlled. Head injury needs higher pressures.'),
